# Flutter / Dart craft — Dextop UI layer

Applies when editing anything under `lib/` (and the Dart-facing halves of
`test/`): widgets, settings pages, l10n, method channels, tests.

**Docs (if stuck):** https://docs.flutter.dev/ ·
https://dart.dev/effective-dart ·
https://api.flutter.dev/ (widget catalog)

## Stack facts

- Dart SDK ^3.13, Flutter 3.47 stable, `flutter_lints` 6 via
  `analysis_options.yaml` — `flutter analyze` is the lint gate.
- UI kit: `material_3_expressive` + `material_ui` (vendored patch in
  `third_party/material_3_expressive` — read `third_party/README.md` before
  touching; `dependency_overrides` points at the patched tree).
- Flutter drives settings only — desktop pixels never come from Flutter
  (see `.cursor/rules/display-stack.mdc`). `NativeBridge` method channels
  (`app.freedextop/...`) are the seam; heavy logic lives in Kotlin.

## Invariants

1. **Every user-facing string is localized.** App strings live in
   `lib/l10n/app_*.arb` (en, ja, zh, ko, ru, pt, pt_BR) and inline strings in
   `lib/l10n/inline/*.json` + matching
   `android/app/src/main/resources/moe/n4tsu/dextop/l10n/inline_*.properties`.
   A new string added to only one language file is a verify failure of
   intent even when it compiles. Use `currentLocalizations()` /
   `localText(context, key)` — never hardcode UI text.
2. **State reads/writes through `NativeBridge`,** never direct platform
   channels from widgets (shared channels are centralized; see
   `native_display_events.dart` for the broadcast pattern).
3. **Tests**: `flutter_test`. Widget tests for new UI; plain unit tests for
   pure logic. Kotlin/Gradle-only behavior documents a manual or
   instrumented path in the task file.
4. **Style**: match the existing dense-L `ListTile`-in-`Card` settings idiom
   (see `display_topology.dart`); `flutter_lints` + analyzer are the floor,
   not the ceiling.
5. **Deps**: caret ranges, pinned via `flutter pub add`; new named
   dependencies need a rules spoke + README row (hub safety rails).

## Symptom / cause / fix skeleton

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| New string renders as key or English in some locales | String added to `app_en.arb` only | Mirror into every `app_*.arb` + inline json/properties set |
| Analyzer fails on generated l10n files | `flutter gen-l10n` output stale | Regenerate (`flutter generate-l10n` / build), never hand-edit `*.g.dart` |
| Two method-channel handlers fight over one channel | `setMethodCallHandler` overwritten by second page | Use `NativeDisplayEvents`-style shared broadcast stream |

